      "body": "There are 6 new directors who have joined the board in the last 3 years. Of these new board members, 3 were independent directors. The company's board is composed of: 6 new directors. No experienced directors. 1 highly experienced director. 3 independent directors (4 non-independent directors). Director Jignesh Patel is the most experienced director on the board, commencing their role in 2008. Non-Executive & Independent Director Raimeen Maradiya was the last independent director to join the board, commencing their role in 2024. The following issues are considered to be risks according to the Simply Wall St Risk Model: Minority of independent directors. Lack of board continuity. Lack of experienced directors.",
